### J1 — créer un compte
POST http://localhost:8080/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pseudonym": "Aria", "email": "aria@mail.com", "password": "dragon-2026" }

### J2 — se connecter (copier le token et le playerId dans les variables ci-dessous)
POST http://localhost:8080/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "aria@mail.com", "password": "dragon-2026" }

### Variables à remplacer
@token = COLLER_LE_TOKEN
@playerId = COLLER_LE_PLAYER_ID

### J3 — consulter son profil
GET http://localhost:8080/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### L1 — créer un lobby
POST http://localhost:8080/lobbies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### L2 — lister les lobbys
GET http://localhost:8080/lobbies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Variable
@lobbyId = COLLER_LE_LOBBY_ID

### L2 — détail d'un lobby
GET http://localhost:8080/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer un héros (route existante, pour L5)
POST http://localhost:8080/joueurs/{{playerId}}/heros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Thorin", "espece": "NAIN", "classe": "GUERRIER",
  "caracteristiques": { "force": 15, "dexterite": 14, "constitution": 13, "intelligence": 12, "sagesse": 10, "charisme": 8 } }

### Variable
@heroId = COLLER_LE_HERO_ID

### L5 — sélectionner un héros
PUT http://localhost:8080/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}/players/{{playerId}}/hero
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heroId": "{{heroId}}" }

### L6 — lancer la partie
POST http://localhost:8080/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}/game
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### L4 — quitter le lobby
DELETE http://localhost:8080/lobbies/{{lobbyId}}/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
